{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"bfb015b45ec56bc9080bb1dbccf05a15a25dc4b99608fbd7ef3cb43cdfdbc92d","slug":"seismology.seismograph","location":"/seismology/seismograph.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"地震仪","content_includes_title":false,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International","CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/blob/main/source/seismology/seismograph.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/edit/main/source/seismology/seismograph.md","thumbnail":"/seismology101/build/seismograph-e02cda3bbd379cd98bfc069fce8e36b3.jpg","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"seismograph.md","url":"/seismology101/build/seismograph-7548b9263ce198b1e41025f79cd35167.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"div","class":"page-meta","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✍️ 姚家园、田冬冬","key":"gh9qN6gX6w"}],"key":"PlwDhq4bXK"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"📅 2023-04-19","key":"J0RBjGa43y"}],"key":"zbKZMLtBaQ"}],"key":"S3seDMdcPF"}],"key":"E6eeHlXKYJ"},{"type":"thematicBreak","key":"NjWbynV6kg"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"基本原理","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"OC8clfzfpP"}],"identifier":"id","label":"基本原理","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"AIF49sb4QK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"地震仪（seismograph）是检测和记录地面质点运动（位移、速度、加速度、转动等）的仪器，\n主要由地震计（seismometer）和数据记录系统组成。其中，地震计用于直接拾取地面运动并将其转换\n为符合数据记录系统需要的能量形式，而数据记录系统用于记录地面运动。","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"ExEiq83JOA"}],"key":"bQjwYZQOx9"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"如以下卡通图所示，固定在地表的框架上挂有弹簧，并将重物悬挂在弹簧上，可以形象表示地震计；\n固定在框架上的旋转的鼓形象地代表了数据记录系统。当地球表面振动时，框架、弹簧、鼓随之移动，\n而重物悬浮不动。若在重物上固定一支笔，则地表和重物之间的相对运动就会被笔在旋转的鼓面上描绘出来，\n鼓面记录到的运动轨迹代表了地面质点运动，即地震图（seismogram）。可以看出，地震仪的基本原理\n是惯性定律。","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"SDTxUzcorN"}],"key":"njB2nV5d6b"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/build/seismograph-e02cda3bbd379cd98bfc069fce8e36b3.jpg","alt":"地震仪的原理示意图","width":"50%","align":"center","urlSource":"seismograph.jpg","key":"NwzOGPeXzT"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"地震仪的原理示意图。引自\n","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"omR4ubxmva"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.iris.edu/hq/inclass/fact-sheet/how_does_a_seismometer_work","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"How Does a Seismometer Work?","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"ON40gJ9bid"}],"urlSource":"https://www.iris.edu/hq/inclass/fact-sheet/how_does_a_seismometer_work","key":"qwrB0SgpA2"}],"key":"xzTvOMlDN6"}],"key":"OAGm6voCYr"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"G8gdu3QaoT"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"地震学研究中使用的地震仪对地面运动高度敏感，在非常安静的地区，甚至可以检测到 1 纳米的位移，\n几乎与原子间距一样小。大地震（如 2004 年印度尼西亚的苏门答腊地震）产生的地震波可以被全球范围\n的地震仪记录到，振幅高达到几厘米。","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"key":"yImvbOeZGd"}],"key":"Mis4CN2XmY"}],"key":"axNSSqfA5z"}],"key":"cw3yAb6pqX"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"地震图","url":"/seismology/seismogram","group":"地震学基础"},"next":{"title":"地震台站","url":"/seismology/station","group":"地震学基础"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}